stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Empty
    Empty: EMPTY | no amount
    BearerHeld: 5 dollars NOTE
    Armed: TAP READY | 15 seconds
    Receiving: receiving acknowledged kind 04 frames
    Extracting: destination dock CHUNK_OUT
    Recovery: RECOVERY or CLEAR STORAGE

    Empty --> BearerHeld: dock loads complete bearer capsule
    Empty --> Armed: one rising touch edge
    Armed --> Receiving: qualifying peer RSSI at least -60
    Armed --> Empty: timeout or second press
    Receiving --> BearerHeld: complete capsule atomically promoted
    Receiving --> Empty: incomplete receive discarded
    BearerHeld --> Empty: successful final tap ACK
    BearerHeld --> Extracting: destination dock enables CHUNK_OUT
    Extracting --> Empty: successful final dock ACK
    Extracting --> BearerHeld: disconnect or timeout keeps capsule

    Empty --> Recovery: orphan or invalid sidecar detected
    BearerHeld --> Recovery: metadata and stored file disagree
    Recovery --> Empty: explicit operator discard only

    note right of BearerHeld
        bearer-held proves only durable bytes.
        It does not prove the claim is unspent.
    end note

    note right of Recovery
        Never report retained data as empty.
        Touch and new staging are blocked.
    end note
